<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Bavang - 140,000 tonnes Dalrymple/Hadera 15-30/3 $11.00 fio 35,000 shinc/20,000 shex Cetragpa.</p>
<p>Excelsior - 105,000 tonnes Norfolk/Antwerp 1-15/3 $11.00 fio 35,000 shinc/20,000 shex Cetragpa.</p>
<p>Fortune - 55,000 tonnes Neptune Terminal/ARA 21/3-7/3 $11.00/$11.50 fio five days shinc Frapaco.</p>
<p>ORE - River Princess - 110,000 tonnes Nouadhibou/Taranto 15-28/2 $3.95 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc Ilva.</p>
</text>
